+ South Carolina General Assembly 126th Session, 2025-2026 Download This Bill in Microsoft Word Format Indicates Matter Stricken Indicates New Matter H. 3861 STATUS INFORMATION General Bill Sponsors: Reps. Hewitt, Bailey, Brewer, Murphy and Bannister Document Path: LC-0028PH25.docx Introduced in the House on January 30, 2025 Medical, Military, Public and Municipal Affairs Summary: Short-term rentals HISTORY OF LEGISLATIVE ACTIONS Date Body Action Description with journal page number 1/30/2025 House Introduced and read first time ( House Journal-page 44 ) 1/30/2025 House Referred to Committee on Medical, Military, Public and Municipal Affairs ( House Journal-page 44 ) View the latest legislative information at the website VERSIONS OF THIS BILL 01/30/2025 
