+<p class="scbilltitle">TO AMEND THE SOUTH CAROLINA CODE OF LAWS BY ADDING SECTION <a href="../../code/t06c001.php#6-1-195">6-1-195</a> SO AS TO PERMIT A GOVERNING BODY OF A MUNICIPALITY, COUNTY, OR OTHER
