+OR REGULATION THAT PROHIBITS THE RENTAL OF A RESIDENTIAL DWELLING TO A
+SHORT-TERM GUEST AND TO DEFINE TERMS RELATED TO SHORT-TERM RENTALS; BY AMENDING
+SECTION <a href="../../code/t12c036.php#12-36-70">12-36-70</a>, RELATING TO THE DEFINITIONS OF A RETAILER AND A SELLER, SO AS
+TO AMEND THESE DEFINITIONS; BY ADDING SECTION <a href="../../code/t12c036.php#12-36-15">12-36-15</a> SO AS TO DEFINE AN
+ACCOMMODATIONS INTERMEDIARY; BY AMENDING SECTION <a href="../../code/t12c036.php#12-36-920">12-36-920</a>, RELATING TO TAX ON
+ACCOMMODATIONS FOR TRANSIENTS, SO AS TO REMOVE THE PROVISION THAT THIS TAX DOES
