+AMENDING SECTION <a href="../../code/t27c050.php#27-50-250">27-50-250</a>, RELATING TO THE TRANSFER OF A RESIDENTIAL PROPERTY
+TITLE, SO AS TO CHANGE THE TIME REFERENCED FROM NINETY DAYS TO ONE-HUNDRED
+EIGHTY DAYS.<a name="at_7c08853dc"></a></p>
