+<p class="scdirectionallanguage"><a name="bs_num_1_c5bf07df2">S</a>ECTION 1.&nbsp; <a name="dl_07cec0f0b">A</a>rticle 1, Chapter 1, Title 6 of the S.C. Code is
+amended by adding:</p>
